{
  "segments": [
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 1,
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "duration_sec": 3.797,
      "end_sec": 3.797,
      "word_count": 13,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "Europe figured this out. Four percent of global revenue. Proportional. Automatic. No ceiling."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 3.797,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 2,
      "start_sec": 3.997,
      "duration_sec": 3.407,
      "end_sec": 7.405,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "When the fine scales with the company, the formula breaks."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 7.405,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 3,
      "start_sec": 7.605,
      "duration_sec": 5.46,
      "end_sec": 13.064,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Facebook shrugged off a five-billion-dollar American fine and panicked over a European one. The tools exist."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 13.064,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 4,
      "start_sec": 13.264,
      "duration_sec": 3.406,
      "end_sec": 16.671,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Criminal liability for executives \u2014 not the tellers, the architects."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 16.671,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 5,
      "start_sec": 16.871,
      "duration_sec": 6.498,
      "end_sec": 23.369,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Disgorgement \u2014 hand back every dollar earned from the violation, not a negotiated fraction. The legal frameworks are built."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 23.369,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 6,
      "start_sec": 23.569,
      "duration_sec": 3.406,
      "end_sec": 26.975,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The question has never been how. The question is why."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 26.975,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 7,
      "start_sec": 27.175,
      "duration_sec": 4.774,
      "end_sec": 31.949,
      "word_count": 14,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "And the answer is the same math that runs everything else in this video."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 31.949,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 8,
      "start_sec": 32.149,
      "duration_sec": 5.811,
      "end_sec": 37.96,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The companies that benefit from the formula fund the campaigns, staff the advisory boards, draft the legislation."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 37.96,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 9,
      "start_sec": 38.16,
      "duration_sec": 4.431,
      "end_sec": 42.591,
      "word_count": 13,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The fine stays small because the people who pay it set the ceiling."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 42.591,
      "duration_sec": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 10,
      "start_sec": 44.091,
      "duration_sec": 7.52,
      "end_sec": 51.61,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 1.5,
      "text": "Let me show you what the math looks like when you put a face on it. Richard Grimshaw survived the Pinto fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 51.61,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 11,
      "start_sec": 51.81,
      "duration_sec": 8.553,
      "end_sec": 60.363,
      "word_count": 25,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "He grew up carrying scars that covered his body and a verdict that was supposed to change things \u2014 one hundred and twenty-five million dollars"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 60.363,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 12,
      "start_sec": 60.563,
      "duration_sec": 6.504,
      "end_sec": 67.067,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "reduced to three point five million. The message was: we've done the math, and your pain has a price."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 67.067,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 13,
      "start_sec": 67.267,
      "duration_sec": 5.8,
      "end_sec": 73.066,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford paid it and moved on. Yesenia Guitron called the ethics hotline and was fired for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 73.066,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 14,
      "start_sec": 73.266,
      "duration_sec": 5.814,
      "end_sec": 79.081,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "She never worked in banking again. Carrie Tolstedt, who built the quota system, kept fifty-seven million dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 15,
      "start_sec": 79.081,
      "duration_sec": 5.444,
      "end_sec": 84.524,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "The Sackler name is still on a wing of the Guggenheim Museum in New York City."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 84.524,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 16,
      "start_sec": 84.724,
      "duration_sec": 4.091,
      "end_sec": 88.815,
      "word_count": 12,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The Metropolitan Museum took theirs down after public outcry. The Guggenheim hasn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 88.815,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 17,
      "start_sec": 89.015,
      "duration_sec": 6.468,
      "end_sec": 95.483,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "You can walk into one of the most prestigious cultural institutions in the world look up at the wall"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 95.483,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 18,
      "start_sec": 95.683,
      "duration_sec": 6.818,
      "end_sec": 102.501,
      "word_count": 20,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "and read the name of a family that earned their fortune from a drug that killed eight hundred thousand people."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 102.501,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 19,
      "start_sec": 102.701,
      "duration_sec": 6.124,
      "end_sec": 108.825,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "They kept thirteen billion. And they kept the wall. That's the formula. It even gets you a plaque."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 20,
      "start_sec": 108.825,
      "duration_sec": 2.705,
      "end_sec": 111.53,
      "word_count": 8,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "Elliana Esquivel is still making art in Charlotte."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 111.53,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 21,
      "start_sec": 111.73,
      "duration_sec": 7.495,
      "end_sec": 119.225,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "She pivoted to 3D \u2014 not because she chose to, but because the alternative was watching her style get reproduced for free."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 119.225,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 22,
      "start_sec": 119.425,
      "duration_sec": 5.446,
      "end_sec": 124.871,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "If the settlement arrives, her share might cover a month of rent. The model keeps running."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 124.871,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 23,
      "start_sec": 125.071,
      "duration_sec": 6.839,
      "end_sec": 131.911,
      "word_count": 20,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Seventy-four percent of Facebook users still don't know the platform profiles them. The data harvested in 2014 was never deleted."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 131.911,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 24,
      "start_sec": 132.111,
      "duration_sec": 5.777,
      "end_sec": 137.888,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The models built on it were refined. Chris Vialpondo is still in Seattle. Still working two jobs."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 137.888,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 25,
      "start_sec": 138.088,
      "duration_sec": 7.5,
      "end_sec": 145.588,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The algorithm that raised his rent is still running. His fifty percent increase was not a market decision. It was a formula."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 145.588,
      "duration_sec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 26,
      "start_sec": 145.888,
      "duration_sec": 5.797,
      "end_sec": 151.685,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.3,
      "text": "The Grush-Saunby memo put a dollar value on a human life in 1977. Two hundred thousand dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 151.685,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 27,
      "start_sec": 151.885,
      "duration_sec": 6.143,
      "end_sec": 158.028,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Purdue's settlement valued each opioid death at nine thousand. Facebook's fine valued each compromised user at fifty-seven dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 158.028,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 28,
      "start_sec": 158.228,
      "duration_sec": 7.528,
      "end_sec": 165.756,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The AI settlements value each stolen book at three thousand dollars. Elliana's illustrations? Not priced yet. Your Reddit posts? Your YouTube comments?"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 165.756,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 29,
      "start_sec": 165.956,
      "duration_sec": 7.495,
      "end_sec": 173.451,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Your blog from 2016? They'll get priced. And if fifty years of history tells you anything \u2014 you won't like the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 173.451,
      "duration_sec": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 30,
      "start_sec": 174.951,
      "duration_sec": 6.156,
      "end_sec": 181.107,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 1.5,
      "text": "The law doesn't prevent corporate crime. It prices it. The question was never whether they'd break the law."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 181.107,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 31,
      "start_sec": 181.307,
      "duration_sec": 7.183,
      "end_sec": 188.49,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The question is what you're worth. Sources: NHTSA, Grimshaw v. Ford Motor Co. (1981) FTC SEC DOJ ProPublica Copyright Alliance CDC"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 188.49,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 32,
      "start_sec": 188.69,
      "duration_sec": 5.589,
      "end_sec": 194.279,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "European Data Protection Board Washington State AG WCNC Charlotte Good Jobs First Violation Tracker AlixPartners (2019)."
    }
  ],
  "total_duration_sec": 194.279,
  "out": "audio/breaking_law/chapters/voice_ch5_the_reckoning.wav",
